profile: runtime-mirust.retired-short-term-memory.v1
updated_utc: 2026-08-09T22:06:41Z

current_task_state:
  Runtime.MiRust.com local source has been converted to a redirect-only package.
  TinyRustLM.MiRust.com holds the preserved runtime archive and current developer portal.
  MiRust.com no longer names Runtime.MiRust.com as an active subdomain.
  SLMComposer.com and LMComposer.com live routes redirect to TinyRustLM.com.

remaining_live_blocker:
  https://runtime.mirust.com/ still returns the old 200 site until the actual runtime.mirust.com web root is deleted or replaced.
  The FileZilla entry named Runtime.MiRust.com is unsafe for this because it logs into TinyRustLM.MiRust.com.

next_action:
  After a verified runtime.mirust.com FTP profile or web root is available, upload the redirect package controlling files from this repository root and verify Runtime returns 301.

credit_window_handoff_2026_08_09:
  current_truth: Live Runtime routes were observed redirecting to the TinyRustLM developer portal, but no new immutable publication receipt exists. The source-controlled exact verifier is commit 8bf66d9329f5e15fc9358062a71133ae6cd994a2.
  dependency: Finish TinyRustLM.MiRust.com 1.7.0 and verify its destination routes before closing the Runtime redirect gate.
  blocker: The Runtime.MiRust.com FileZilla profile is misbound to the TinyRustLM.MiRust.com root. Do not use it for deployment.
  next_action: Obtain a verified Runtime-only deployment profile, run the exact redirect gate, and preserve transport plus HTTPS evidence before claiming a new publication.
